----------------------------------------QBlade Wave Definition File-------------------------------------------------
----------------------------------------Object Name-----------------------------------------------------------------
WaveL	OBJECTNAME	- the name of the linear wave definition object

----------------------------------------Main Parameters-------------------------------------------------------------
0.000000	TIMEOFFSET	- the time offset from t=0s [s]
3	WAVETYPE	- QBlade wave type
2.500000	SIGHEIGHT	- the significant wave height (Hs) [m]
8.500000	PEAKPERIOD	- the peak period (Tp) [s]
1	AUTOGAMMA	- use gamma according to IEC
0.000000	GAMMA	- custom gamma
1	AUTOSIGMA	- use sigmas according to IEC
0.000000	SIGMA1	- sigma1
0.000000	SIGMA2	- sigma2
0	DOUBLEPEAK	- double peak Torsethaugen
0	AUTOORCHI	- automatic OCHI-HUBBLE parameters
0.100000	MODFREQ1	- modal frequency 1
0.200000	MODFREQ2	- modal frequency 2
2.000000	SIGHEIGHT1	- significant height 1
1.500000	SIGHEIGHT2	- significant height 2
2.000000	LAMBDA1	- peak shape 1
2.000000	LAMBDA2	- peak shape 2

----------------------------------------Frequency Discretization ---------------------------------------------------
0	DISCTYPE	- frequency discretization type
1	AUTOFREQ	- use automatic frequency range
0.000000	FCUTIN	- cut-in frequency
0.000000	FCUTOUT	- cut-out frequency
0.000000	MAXFBIN	- maximum freq. bin width [Hz]
12	NUMFREQ	- the number of frequency bins
0	RANDSEED	- the seed for the random phase generator

----------------------------------------Directional Discretization (Equal Energy)-----------------------------------
0	DIRTYPE	- directional type
0.000000	DIRMEAN	- mean wave direction [deg]
30.000000	DIRMAX	- directional spread [deg]
2.000000	SPREADEXP	- spreading exponent
1	NUMDIR	- the number of directional bins

